    "detailed_description": "&quot;Dreamscape Return&quot; is a simple yet challenging puzzle game. In this game, the player's task is to connect all the patterns, but there is an important rule: you cannot repeat the lines you have already walked.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe rules of the game are very simple. Each level starts from a designated starting pattern. Players need to plan the path cleverly to ensure that a line connects all patterns. Carefully designing routes and thinking quickly are the keys to successfully completing each level. Players need to complete the challenge within the stipulated 5 minutes. When the challenge time is insufficient, the game provides a button option to skip this level. Players can choose to continue the challenge or directly enter the next level.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n&quot;Dreamscape Return&quot; not only exercises players' spatial cognition and logical thinking abilities, but also provides players with a pleasant and relaxing gaming experience. Get ready to take on the challenge, push your limits and have fun playing the game!",
